It is a good game. It is a first person shooter with lots of action. Up to 4 players at once, in single player you have 3 other AI friends.
Pros:
+ fun;
+ action, you start shooting in 5 seconds or less;
+ the AI players help you and you need to stick together to survive;
+ different weapons that make a big difference in the playing style;
+ easy to replay;
+ very balanced multiple player, not cash trap and character are balanced, so expertise makes the difference on your scores;
Cons:
- short stories, 1h to 2 hours, the focus is on replay the same map;
- fixed maps in each story, so if you play a lot it get easy to remember, but you have 5 unique stories and maps;
- I am not fan of multiplayer games and this one goes for it;

After 30 min playing I got in a part that was so laggy I couldn't even play;
I run CS GO and Left 4 Dead at 60 FPS with no problem.
Everything was poorly made; You will be bored fast.
I'm glad I didn't boght the whole series of the game;

