This game is a fantasy adventure in the world of mercenary named Raven.
Good in game:
Continuation of the first part of the game, preserving the genre and gameplay (RPG in real-time mode);
The graphics and animation;
The story and action (the game even begins with chase);
Various weapons;
Achievements and Steam cards;
Minus one - the lack of Russian localization.
I recommend to all fans of the RPG genre, and especially to those who played in the first part.

